                                "sense_id": "5f4dc3f9-a59c-3a61-a22e-85e31214b53e",
                                "text": "She began talking of the way they had died – blackwater, malaria, a neglected appendix."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5c022be4-daf0-322c-bd7d-8da87d3222bb",
                        "entry_id": "59c95b1c-4831-3919-86de-457988326e6b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Waste from domestic toilets; water containing fecal matter."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "uncountable",
                            "usually"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "81d9a4fb-8e31-450e-a042-c3a8cf2146af",
                                "sense_id": "5c022be4-daf0-322c-bd7d-8da87d3222bb",
                                "text": "Ms. Conlin failed to report, among other things, that air emissions are regulated and that our industry is exploring new technologies to further reduce emissions; that our ships treat all blackwater; and that advanced wastewater purification systems discharge water cleaner than most municipal water treatment plants."
                            }
                        ]
